{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c9c6d9bf2658ff4a0ab84f6ed19b49a90aed8785be75ce9c10bbabe909e20184", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nA presentation is defined as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0e421fe5012be092f458e46633b549c0743dc1d3da877aa4506687c5ccc9028d", "unit_id": "tag:06KW:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\varphi : [U/R] \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:12224da498ced587d7b8c8014c285bb4c07fc105c9ef151ee79d8499511d59de", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8df5a3d76c24f53049a2624b5c4b14c9839048dca4a95d7d1c81212263dcbff2", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category cofibered in groupoids over a category\n<MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be a groupoid in functors on\n<MATH_0004>. A\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>presentation of <MATH_0005> by <MATH_0006><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is an equivalence\n<MATH_0007> of categories cofibered in groupoids\nover <MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d8a1f04fb3194b0ccc39fc2faf476b3bbf5dae4a71f75e49ae82c8ad9769ad68", "unit_id": "tag:06KX:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c9c6d9bf2658ff4a0ab84f6ed19b49a90aed8785be75ce9c10bbabe909e20184", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following two general lemmas will be used to get presentations.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:51346b21d6eaf1e881f5dd9f6c79d98f493a26f94d3d7709df6fb570d4f2b959", "unit_id": "tag:06KW:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$U : \\mathcal{C} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0004": "$f : U \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$R, s, t, c$", "MATH_0007": "$R : \\mathcal{C} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0008": "$U \\times_{f, \\mathcal{F}, f} U$", "MATH_0009": "$t, s : R \\to U$", "MATH_0010": "$c : R \\times_{s, U, t} R \\to R$", "MATH_0011": "$U \\times_{f, \\mathcal{F}, f} U \\times_{f, \\mathcal{F}, f} U$", "MATH_0012": "$R \\times_{s, U, t} R \\to\nU \\times_{f, \\mathcal{F}, f} U \\times_{f, \\mathcal{F}, f} U$", "MATH_0013": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-presentation-construction}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d05ad197cde031a7dbb5d916aeea4c425c45c5f14e2a89f1668b526a23031b38", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:931bff39abe14055eb6f301afa1cca85ecff8c84606b2158c6a7d101ed24d9f6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be category cofibered in groupoids over a category\n<MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be a functor.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a morphism of categories cofibered in groupoids\nover <MATH_0005>. Define <MATH_0006> as follows:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007> is the functor\n<MATH_0008>.\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009> are the first and second projections,\nrespectively.\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0010> is the morphism given by projection\nonto the first and last factors of\n<MATH_0011>\nunder the canonical isomorphism\n<MATH_0012>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nThen <MATH_0013> is a groupoid in functors on <MATH_0014>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a020b165c7943138ae58497c607bb58d6dd3b7403e17c688811895e9d2cc6576", "unit_id": "tag:06KY:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:32e0ee477b49ddc679b01e5333c84081320584055ee324a8b5963f99eb5b8665", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:06KY:proof"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$U : \\mathcal{C} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0004": "$f : U \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$f : U \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0009": "$[f] : [U/R] \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0010": "$[f]: [U/R] \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0011": "$[f]: [U/R] \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0012": "$f : U \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-presentation-construction}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-presentation-morphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0e86e205c342f95682d81b4ce0823409f755e9582c1791ddf217b98fbbd4775e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:70eb2dc2a8a56398651fc9ec5e945691d9206d203d496e2f2b0f09b09d3f94f7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be category cofibered in groupoids over a category\n<MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be a functor.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a morphism of categories cofibered in groupoids\nover <MATH_0005>. Let <MATH_0006> be the groupoid in functors on\n<MATH_0007> constructed from <MATH_0008> in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThen there is a natural morphism <MATH_0009> such that:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0010> is fully faithful.\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0011> is an equivalence if and only if\n<MATH_0012> is essentially surjective.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c3378e3ac7fdddb1c7216cf97c6106eeda6fa9d06ecb352af677fce301fec03f", "unit_id": "tag:06KZ:statement"}
